      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it would be even better if instead of preset shown/blocked settings when lobby has 10,20,30, etc people, the user can make their own custom saftey settings profiles to have what they want to be specifically shown/blocked at 10,20,30 etc people.",
